  "body": "Looking for a brand-new home that offers modern comfort, low-maintenance living, and a great location, this one is must-see.\r\n\r\nNestled in a peaceful cul-de-sac, this beautifully presented two-level terrace home features 3 generous double bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms (including a master ensuite), a sunny open-plan living area, a modern kitchen, a sun-filled deck, and a single internal-access garage. The first one in the row also presents the optimal choice!\r\n\r\nDownstairs is designed for easy everyday living, featuring a sunny and spacious open-plan lounge, dining, and kitchen area that flows seamlessly to the outdoor deck and fully fenced backyard, creating the perfect indoor-outdoor lifestyle.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, you'll find three well-sized bedrooms and small setting area, offering space and privacy for the whole family. Both the master bedroom and second bedroom enjoy views of Mt Pigeon, adding an extra touch of charm.\r\n\r\nThe easy-care section means less time on maintenance and more time enjoying life, while a heat pump keeps the home comfortable all year round.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n• Freehold 159sqm (mol) section, approx. 134.6sqm floor area\r\n• 3 double bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms including master ensuite\r\n• Light-filled open-plan living and dining\r\n• Modern kitchen with quality appliances and finishes\r\n• Sunny deck and fully fenced backyard\r\n• Single internal-access garage\r\n• Heat pump for year-round comfort\r\n• Pigeon Mountain views from two bedrooms\r\n\r\nLocated in a family-friendly neighbourhood, you're just minutes from Highland Park Shopping Centre, Pak'n Save, Lloyd Elsmore Park, local cafés, and everyday amenities. Zoned for sought-after schools including Macleans Primary, Howick Intermediate, and Pakuranga College.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer, growing family, or savvy investor, this brand-new home offers an easy-care lifestyle in a location that's always in demand.\r\n\r\nCome along to the open homes or give us a call to arrange your private viewing. This could be the one you've been waiting for!",
